  "description": "Sarah turned a simple idea into an app called Stella. In JUST 2 months she hit $340K/Month. But... there’s a bigger story here: building apps is getting easier and easier. So who is going to win? Well, in this video, we break down how Sarah built a $300K/month app, and why she thinks she's the first of a much bigger wave.\n\n*Free: iOS Bootcamp:* https://clickhubspot.com/xg54 \n\nFollow Sarah: https://twitter.com/hhpriestess\nCheck out Stella: https://apps.apple.com/us/app/stella-manifest-anything/id6757347283\n\n🔔 Follow the Second Channel: @StarterStoryBuild \n🏁 We're hiring: starterstory.com/jobs\n\nChapters:\n0:00 - She built this app\n0:55 - Meet Sarah\n1:26 - App breakdown\n2:36 - \"But you have a following?\"\n3:27 - Sarah's background\n4:34 - The year of iOS\n5:15 - Finding the app idea\n6:23 - Tech stack\n7:08 - The next wave of builders\n8:58 - Distribution and virality\n10:16 - Marketing examples\n12:41 - Advice to younger self\n14:32 - Pat and Gus: the next wave of builders\n\nThis video is an educational case study of this founder’s experience. It is not financial advice and does not guarantee any income or results. Every business is different and your results may vary.",
